rces and Services Administration Uninsured Program\"}]},\"equity_action\":{\"v\":false,\"ev\":[]},\"equity_measurement\":\"Area-level proxy: zip codes classified into tertiles of the Equitable Distribution Index (a composite of SES, household composition/disability, minority status/language, housing/transportation); no person-level SPD data; denominators from 2018 SVI data.\"},\"groupwise\":[{\"across\":[\"SES\"],\"n_groups\":3,\"ordered\":true,\"assessment\":\"side by side\",\"resolves_to_finer\":false,\"ev\":[{\"loc\":\"text\",\"q\":\"the highest rates of oral antiviral prescriptions dispensed were in low-vulnerability zip codes (373.3 per 100,000), followed by medium- (359.5) and high- (287.4)\"}]}],\"uncertain_fields\":[\"study_design\",\"groupwise\",\"equity.level\"],\"confidence\":\"medium\",\"notes\":\"Study design is not named; surveillance/descriptive and ecologic are inferred from zip code–level aggregate rates. The 7-day moving averages of deaths and hospitalizations and the 88% within 5 miles estimate are cited context, not the article's own procedures.\",\"view_issues\":\"The start of the second period is given as March 6 in places and March 7 in others.\"}", "type": "text"}]}